                                                "example_id": "0e92fcf8-2021-4f06-bdf5-034da0433dcc",
                                                "sense_id": "ba001b0b-538a-316a-b48d-43ce31ca355e",
                                                "text": "Sometimes referred to as the “Prussia of Africa,” Rwanda insists on enormous self-discipline from every citizen."
